direction: down
title: Colocate Join 优化原理

bad: 不同 sharding key {class: base}
bad_t1: orders\nsharding = cityHash64(order_id) {class: base}
bad_t2: order_items\nsharding = cityHash64(item_id) {class: base}
bad_join: SELECT ... FROM orders\nJOIN order_items USING (order_id) {class: base}
bad_result: 必须把右表全量\n广播到所有 shard\nO(N × shards) 网络 {class: base}

bad -> bad_t1
bad -> bad_t2
bad_t1 -> bad_join
bad_t2 -> bad_join
bad_join -> bad_result

good: 相同 sharding key {class: base}
good_t1: orders\nsharding = cityHash64(order_id) {class: base}
good_t2: order_items\nsharding = cityHash64(order_id) {class: base}
good_join: SELECT ... FROM orders\nJOIN order_items USING (order_id) {class: base}
good_result: 每个 shard 内\n本地 join 即可\nO(N) 网络 {class: base}

good -> good_t1
good -> good_t2
good_t1 -> good_join
good_t2 -> good_join
good_join -> good_result

good_result.class: accent
